# PvP Interaction / Compatibility system — project-fitted spec (rev. 2026-08-19)

Add a PvP interaction system to Comp Forge so the engine and the dashboard
understand how weapon abilities interact with duplicates, reflects, purges,
cleanses, CC classes, and Albion's global PvP rules — not just what role a
weapon plays.

> REVISION NOTE (what changed from the original prompt and why)
>
> The original was written for a generic TypeScript app. This repo is a
> Python engine (`engine/engine.py`) line-mirrored by
> `pipeline/app_scoring.js` (twin-engine parity at 1e-9 is a hard gate),
